**Q: The method belongs to pooling methods used for networks. Some related works are missing. LiftPool: Bidirectional ConvNet Pooling. J. Zhao and C. Snoek. ICLR 2021. Refining activation downsampling with SoftPool. A. Stergiou et. al. ICCV 2021.**  
